~ start
do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(5000,600), 0.75, 2.0, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn starry: [wave freq=7 amp=30]Hello again![/wave]
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Az","left")
Az: What're you doing here?
Az annoy: [shake level=7 rate=30]I told you to stay behind![/shake]
Fenn starry: Adventure![wait=0.3] [wave freq=8 amp=30]I must save the Knights![/wave]
Az: [shake level=7 rate=30]Ugh[/shake]. Not like it matters. 
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Az","right")
Az: [i]cough[/i] That ice is blocking everything.
Fenn starry: Ooooh![wait=0.3] You can breath fire, right?! [wait=0.3] Like your [color="B80006"]Dad[/color]?
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(12000,100), 1.33, 3.0, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az: Yeah I don't think so.
Fenn starry: [wave freq=7 amp=30][color="B80006"]Sir Abdul[/color] could melt that, easy! [/wave]
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(5000,600), 0.75, 2.0, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Az","left")
Az: Yeah.[wait=0.3] And I'm not my [color="B80006"]Baba[/color].
Az: [i]cough[/i] We need a way around to get to my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color].
Fenn: Huh... the [color="8A0194"]Wizard[/color] was also looking for a [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color].
Az: [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=30]What?![/shake][/font_size] Why does he want my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]?
Fenn: I dunno. But if we need a way out, I could go through that grate!
Az annoy: [font_size=30]Ugh, I hate this.[/font_size]
Az: [font_size=60]FINE.[/font_size] You go down there. [i]cough[/i] I'll find another way around.
Az: And take one of these, [wait=0.3]I guess.
Az hands Fenn something
Fenn: A bracelet?
Az: A bangle.
Fenn: What's it do?
Az: Uh. Well, [wait=0.3]I should be able to help you, even if I'm not there.
Fenn starry: Whoa... really?? [wait=0.3]That's so cool!
Az: Be careful, Fenn.
Fenn starry: [wave freq=7 amp=30]No promises![/wave]
Az annoy: Nevermind.
do EventFlags.set_flag("Az-Stuck-Pantry", true)
=> END